'''Klub Futbollistik Arbëria''', commonly known as '''Arbëria''', is a professional [[Football team|football club]] based in village [[Dobrajë e Madhe]] of [[Lipjan]], [[Kosovo]]. The club play in the [[Football Superleague of Kosovo]], which is the second tier of football in the country."}}
